<p>Activate some of your inner magic, using it to power your abilities.  For the next <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns all active talents will be used without resource cost.</p><p>Your resources must still be high enough to initially power the talent and failure rates (etc.) still apply.</p><p></p>